  "id": "operation-fortress-europa-v1",
  "name": "Operation Fortress Europa",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "Prolution",
  "description": "Introducing a new custom operation: Fortress Europa!!! You invaded and defeated the Axis during Operation Overlord. Now it is time to switch sides and play defense. Take over the defenses of the Atlantic wall and drive the allies back into the sea!!!\nTwo options to play!\na). First DDAY mission in Campaign - this has no time limit (hardest mode)\nb). Last operation in Operations - this has a 60 minute time limit (hard mode)",
